# XRHome Cloud Functions Environment Variables
# Copy this file to '.env' in this directory if deploying your own instance of this service to allow Google Auth to work with Firebase auth and a Web API key.
#
# NOTE: Gemini API Keys, Home Assistant Long-Lived Tokens, and Nabu Casa URLs
# are dynamically entered by users through the in-headset UI prompt or pairing.html
# and stored securely under each user's authenticated Google profile.
# They are no longer stored in this backend environment file.

# ==========================================
# Firebase Client Configuration (Auth/Web)
# ==========================================
# Your Firebase Web API Key so that Google Sign-In can initialize in the client
WEB_API_KEY=your_firebase_api_key_here
